  "id": "zaleplon",
  "term": "zaleplon",
  "definition": "Zaleplon is a nonbenzodiazepine drug in the pyrazolopyrimidine class with sleep-inducing, calming, anxiety-reducing, and muscle-relaxing effects. It acts on GABA-A receptor systems in the brain, influencing the chloride channel complex and strengthening GABA’s inhibitory activity.",
